OL,3,GNEWSACatherine returns to hospice to
OL,4,Ameet children
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, the Princess of Wales, has
OL,7,Frevisited a children's hospice 14 years
OL,8,Fafter opening the site for the first
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,11,FThe princess, who is the patron of East
OL,12,FAnglia's Children's Hospices (EACH),
OL,13,Fspent nearly an hour talking to
OL,14,Fchildren and families receiving care at
OL,15,FThe Treehouse hospice in Ipswich.
OL,17,FThe hospice, which opened in 2012,
OL,18,Fprovides short breaks and palliative
OL,19,Fsupport for children and young people
OL,20,Fwith life-limiting conditions and a
OL,21,Fbereavement service for families.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
